{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"shaodi-p0098","name":"燧人氏","evidence":["shaodi-q-o083"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"shaodi-m-o083-shaodi-p0098","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o083"]},{"id":"shaodi-m-o084-shaodi-p0098","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["shaodi-q-o084"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-q-o083","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-59cdbac86f299ef21222","layer":"original","quote":"《易》博士淳于俊对曰〖9〗：“包羲因燧皇之图而制八卦〖10〗，神农演之为六十四〖11〗，黄帝、尧、舜通其变。三代随时〖12〗，质文各由其事〖13〗。故《易》者，变易也；名曰《连山》，似山出纳〔云〕气〖14〗，连天地也；《归藏》者，万事莫不归藏于其中也。”","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":400,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":127},{"id":"shaodi-q-o084","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8e790986833fb21e2a1b","layer":"original","quote":"帝又曰：“若使包羲因燧皇而作《易》，孔子何以不云‘燧人氏没包羲氏作’乎〖15〗？”俊不能答。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":401,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":46}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
